WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.917
The camera records a picture.

00:00:01.917 --> 00:00:03.500
The microphone records sound.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.250
How do you line them up?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.625
Watch the top stick.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:08.083
When it meets the board, you can see the exact frame.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:10.708
You can hear the same clap as a short spike in the recording.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:13.792
Slide that spike under the frame where the sticks touch.

00:00:13.792 --> 00:00:16.167
One clap gives both tracks the same starting mark.
